"StdOut: " &amp; ZIPFiles.StdOutputStr &amp; lf &amp;
"StdErr:" &amp; ZIPFiles.ErrOutputStr</From></Assign></IncomingLinks><OutgoingLinks/></Action></Actions></Step></Steps><Actions><Action><Name>Conditional_ZIPFailed</Name><Description> </Description><Expiration/><IncomingLinks><Assign xsi:type="Assign"><Name/><Description/><To>Conditional_ZIPFailed.Input1</To><From>ZIPFiles.StdOutputStr == ""
